WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Pong: the fitted controller predicts a target height and selects hold, up or down. The highlighted button is its recorded choice.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Doom: the fitted controller reads the target bearing, turns toward it, and fires within eight degrees. These are actions, not confidence scores.
